  "body": "Possibly the best bang for your buck you'll find on the Auckland waterfront or anywhere in New Zealand!\r\n\r\nStep almost directly from your private deck onto the boat for a quick evening fish or Gulf Cruise. Perfectly positioned, marina frontage, this upgraded townhome offers the ultimate low-maintenance waterfront lifestyle for boating enthusiasts and buyers seeking effortless coastal living.\r\n\r\nInside, approximately 136 square metres of light-filled living space flows effortlessly through bi-fold doors onto the marina-side composite deck, ideal for outdoor entertaining. The modern kitchen showcases timeless granite countertops while outdoor living options on both sides of the home ensure you can track the sun throughout the day.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes three double bedrooms, two full modern bathrooms including the ensuite, plus a convenient separate toilet on the ground floor. Practicality is equally well addressed with a large double garage offering secure storage for vehicles and water toys. There's a loft in the garage for long term store items, plus the house features drop-down stairs in the ceiling for attic storage. Additional features include the gas fireplace, gas cooking and hot water and a heat transfer system, a private balcony off the master, plus a master walk in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBeyond your private 12-metre berth, you are just a short stroll from vibrant marina dining, local shops, and the Auckland city ferry. Top schooling, including Wentworth College and Primary as well as Gulf Harbour Primary School, and the trails of Shakespear Regional Park are all just minutes away. This property delivers rare marina-front luxury and direct gulf access at a fraction of beachfront pricing. A truly desirable lock and leave property that offers one of the best price-to-lifestyle ratios anywhere in New Zealand!",
